¥ Chr_Nar_Raven_Declarative_01.png2)<smallcaps>Rodrick Blackthorn</smallcaps>:ïThat was quite rude, cousin. <b>My dragon slunk back to my pit bloodied and battered. How unkind of you to spoil his feast.</b> It seems you‚Äôve become a parasite on these lands‚Äîno matter where I turn, your armies infest every corner.

